ellent communication skills and the ability to effectively collaborate with cross-functional teams to drive projects forward and achieve business objectives.", "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/search/?currentJobId=4403921810&keywords=data%20analyst%20Morocco&location=Morocco"}
